<!--
  Monochrome layer for themed icons (API 33+). The launcher tints this with the user's
  wallpaper colours, so it must be a flat silhouette: no gradients, no alpha shading, and
  no reliance on colour to read.

  Same crescent geometry as the foreground, with the spark kept as a separate solid dot so
  the mark still reads as "moon plus light" in a single colour.
-->
